--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library provides DeepStream GStreamer helper APIs for custom queries,
events, and bus messages, plus NvBufSurface memory-type helpers used by other
plugins.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- libnvbufsurface.so and libnvbufsurftransform.so
- libglib2.0 Development package
- libgstreamer1.0 Development package (including base and rtp)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvdsgst_helper.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
